  \resources\SystemSettings_Activate_WORKSTATION_REQUIRED:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Ní féidir an leagan seo de Windows a rith ar chrua-earraí atá cumraithe ar do ghléas. Gabh chuig an Store chun leagan tacaithe Windows a cheannach.
  \resources\SystemSettings_Activate_NEVER_ACTIVATED_CONTENT:
    Candidate Language=GA-IE: Gníomhachtaigh ionas gur féidir leat Windows a phearsantú.
